face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사람 \n            크기 정도로 커버려버린 돌연변이 쥐들이 브리타니아에 살고 있는데 \n            마법사 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">몬데인이 \n            실험한 쥐가 풀렸기때문이라는 소문이 있다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이들은 \n            보통 쥐와 틀린 점이라고는 큰 몸체를 가진 것과 보다 강하다는 것을 \n            제외하고는 쥐와 같다. 이들은 보통 브리튼 하수도에서 주로 살며 던젼에서도 \n            발견되는데 이걸로 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">보아 \n            이들은 어두운 것을 좋아하는 것도 보통 쥐랑 같다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:120%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:2; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Comment \n                                        by </span></font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Pink</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;: \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"470\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"26\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/pink.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"65\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:40/65\" width=\"40\"></b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"424\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">전브리타니아에 고루 분포되어 있으며 가장 인간의 가까이에서 서식하는 </span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">몬스터이다. 굳이 몬스터라고 할정도로 극심한 피해와 대단한 공격력또는 \n저항력을 가진것은 아니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;\n            </p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"> <font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">말그대로 쥐라는 것인데 가끔 거대쥐(a giant rat)라는 변종도 볼수있지만 그것 \n            또한 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그리 주의를 \n해야할정도 강하지가 못하고 너무 자주 보이기때문에 친근감마저 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">들기도한다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">브리타니아세계에 첫발을 내딛는 전사라도 문제없이 이것을 \n처치할 수 있을 것이며 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">주먹으로도 없앨수있을만큼 약하다. <br>아마 몽뱃과 더불어 최약체 몬스터라 해도 자신들을 변명할수있는 특별한 힘을 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">보여주진 \n못하리라 생각된다. <br>a giant rat 이라는 거대쥐와 a sewer rat이라는 자그마한 쥐로 구분이된다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:120%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:2; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Comment \n                                        by </span></font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Keme</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;: \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"470\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"26\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/keme.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"65\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/65\" width=\"30\"></b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"424\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">극 초반에 초보들이 돈 벌기 가장 좋은 몬스터(?)입니다. </span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기스킬 없이 들어가도 손쉽게 잡을수 있는 몬스터입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">&nbsp;\n            </p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"> <font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">특히 초보들은 브리튼 \n하수구에서 쥐를 잡으면서 공격 방법, 도망가는 방법, </span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">기타 메크로나 컨트롤 방법을 익힐때 제일 좋습니다. ^^ </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">빨리 잡을수 있어서 아주 좋죠. \n공격력, 방어력도 약해서 중급 전사라도 단 한방에 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">끝내버리는 최약체 몬스터입니다. 아마 몽뱃과 1:1 해도 비슷할듯 ㅡㅡ;;;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"